{"version":1,"content":"<p>【痴線的國度 😂】法國國會 30 日審議 2027 年度財政預算案時，通過惡名昭彰的「網絡流量稅」。</p><p>根據該條款，內容服務商每向法國境內用戶傳送 1GB 數據，須繳納 0.055 歐元（約新台幣 1.9 元 / 0.46 港元）的數據傳輸稅。</p><p>這項政策直接鎖定佔據龐大頻寬的 Netflix、Google、Amazon 等串流媒體與雲端巨頭，預估每年可為法國國庫帶來最高 100 億歐元收入。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.383211+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:17:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.875830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.065537+00:00","content_hash":"af68a11e38c42dd3fa8e04b9fff13ab41e07732a574adec6c6e9d391134866c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}